{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35899","headline":"早发潜水驿谒郎中员外 · 胡曾","name":"早发潜水驿谒郎中员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半床秋月一声鸡，万里行人费马蹄。\n青野雾销凝晋洞，碧山烟散避秦溪。\n楼台稍辨乌城外，更漏微闻鹤柱西。\n已是大仙怜後进，不应来向武陵迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}